OL,3,AFarmers' fury at online scramble for
OL,4,A#233m funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of farmers missed out on
OL,7,Fvital government funding after online
OL,8,Fapplications for a #233m green scheme
OL,9,Ffor the whole of England closed down in
OL,10,Funder six hours.
OL,12,FFarming and environmental groups
OL,13,Fcondemned the race to secure the
OL,14,Fsustainable farming incentive (SFI)
OL,15,Ffunding, with some comparing it to a
OL,16,F"frantic" online scramble to secure
OL,17,FGlastonbury or Oasis gig tickets.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
