OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFarmers' fury at online scramble for
OL,4,A#233m funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe post-Brexit scheme, which replaced
OL,7,FEU subsidies with payments for farmers
OL,8,Fto look after nature and provide
OL,9,F"public goods", opened at 10:00 BST on
OL,10,FTuesday but had run out of budget by
OL,11,F15:48 BST.
OL,13,FThe government said farmers had
OL,14,Fresponded "in force" to the scheme and
OL,15,Fthere would be further funding
OL,16,Fopportunities for 2027.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
